<title>USA: NY business loans rose $1.292 bln in Nov 27 week.</title>
<headline>NY business loans rose $1.292 bln in Nov 27 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans at the six major New York banks, excluding acceptances, rose $1,292 million to $43,203 million in the week ended November 27, the Federal Reserve Bank of New York said.</p>
<p>Including acceptances, loans rose $1,317 million to $43,490 million.</p>
<p>Commercial paper outstanding nationally rose $2,628 million to $765,298 million.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
